      "zh": "就打发他儿子约兰去见大卫王，问他的安，为他祝福，因为他杀败了哈大底谢（原来陀以与哈大底谢常常争战）。约兰带了金银铜的器皿来，",
      "en": "he[NOTE:1] sent his son Joram[NOTE:2] to King David to extend his best wishes[NOTE:3] and to pronounce a blessing on him for his victory over Hadadezer, for Toi had been at war with Hadadezer.[NOTE:4] He brought with him various items made of silver, gold, and bronze.[NOTE:5]",
      "notes": [
